<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="wrap narrow section prose">
  <h1>How <%= siteName %> works</h1>
  <p class="lead">Finding a place in Accra usually means paying an agent a 10% commission (or a full month's rent), plus “viewing fees” for every house you see. We cut out the middleman: landlords list directly, and you deal directly with them.</p>

  <h2 id="tenants">For tenants</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Search</strong> by neighbourhood, budget, bedrooms and must-haves like a borehole, prepaid meter or security.</li>
    <li><strong>See the true cost.</strong> Every listing shows the monthly rent, the months of advance required, and the total you'll need to move in.</li>
    <li><strong>Contact the landlord</strong> through in-app messages, a phone call or WhatsApp — it's free.</li>
    <li><strong>Book a viewing</strong> and go see the place. Never pay before you've viewed it.</li>
    <li><strong>Sign a tenancy agreement</strong> directly with the landlord and get a receipt for every payment.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2 id="landlords">For landlords</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Create a free landlord account</strong> with your name and phone number.</li>
    <li><strong>Verify with your Ghana Card</strong> (recommended). Verified landlords publish instantly and get a trust badge.</li>
    <li><strong>Post your property</strong> with real photos, the rent, advance and amenities. Unverified listings are reviewed within about a day.</li>
    <li><strong>Answer enquiries and confirm viewings</strong> from your dashboard.</li>
    <li><strong>Mark as rented</strong> once you've found your tenant — relist it any time it's free again.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>What it costs</h2>
  <p>Nothing. Listing, searching, messaging and booking viewings are free for everyone. No one on the platform is allowed to charge tenants an agent, commission or viewing fee — report any listing that does.</p>

  <p><a class="btn" href="/listings">Browse homes</a> <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/register?role=landlord">List a property</a></p>
</section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
